WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
COBRA — Website Features Showcase
COBRA public website feature tour

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Website Features Showcase
cobracardiff.co.uk

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.500
FIND YOUR WAY
Menu → Results → Race statistics

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.500
PLAN YOUR RACE DAY
Race Day → schedules and drivers briefing

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:25.500
CHOOSE YOUR RACE
Select the event, then the individual race.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:33.500
FOLLOW THE RACE
Recorded positions at every lap crossing.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:41.500
SEE EVERY DRIVER’S PACE
Stacked lap charts make each driver easy to read.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.500
LOOK CLOSER AT THE DATA
Compare lap times on one shared scale.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.500
CHOOSE YOUR RIVALS
Tick two or more drivers in the same race.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:01.500
COMPARE LAP BY LAP
See where the time was gained or lost.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:09.500
GO HEAD TO HEAD
Compare shared meetings and same-final results.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:17.500
OPEN A DRIVER PROFILE
Tap a driver name for their racing record.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:23.500
EXPLORE THE RANKINGS
Filter dates and class; choose a ranking measure.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:31.500
SEE HOW FAR YOU’VE RACED
Open the distance map from a driver profile.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:37.500
FOLLOW YOUR CHAMPIONSHIP
Results → Club Series or SWORD Championship

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:44.500
PUT A CAR TO THE NAME
COBRA Data → Driver car avatars

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:50.500
CELEBRATE THE PODIUM
Results → Podium gallery

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:56.500
FIND A SETUP
Filter shared setups by maker, class or event.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:02.500
LEARN FROM OTHER RACERS
Open the setup sheet and read the driver’s notes.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:08.500
EXPLORE TRACK LAYOUTS
Replay uses event track plans where available.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:16.500
CONTROL THE REPLAY
Play, pause, change speed or seek along the timeline.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:24.500
WATCH YOUR SELECTED DRIVERS
Real lap timing. Estimated motion between crossings.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:30.500
OPEN IT. SHARE IT.
Open a full chart or share your comparison link.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:36.500
YOUR RACE. YOUR REPLAY.
cobracardiff.co.uk

